---

<section class="contact-cta dark-section">
  <div class="glow-tr"></div>
  <div class="container">
    <span class="section-num">— 05 Contatti</span>
    <h2>Prima di un contratto, <span class="accent">una conversazione.</span></h2>
    <p class="contact-text">
      Trenta minuti, senza impegno. Mi racconti la situazione, ti dico onestamente
      se posso esserti utile e in che forma. Se non lo sono, ti indico chi può.
    </p>
    <a href="/contatti/" class="btn btn-outline">Contattaci ora →</a>

    <div class="contact-info">
      <div>
        <div class="contact-info-label">Email</div>
        <div class="contact-info-val">info@rm-solution.it</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="contact-info-label">Telefono</div>
        <div class="contact-info-val">+39 347 540 0385</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="contact-info-label">Sede</div>
        <div class="contact-info-val">Gallarate (VA)</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .contact-cta h2 {
    font-size: clamp(28px, 4.5vw, 44px);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    color: #fff;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    max-width: 540px;
  }
  .contact-text {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-light);
    max-width: 480px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  .contact-info {
    margin-top: 48px;
    padding-top: 32px;
    border-top: 0.5px solid var(--rule-dark);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
  }
  .contact-info-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--text-light-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .contact-info-val {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .contact-info {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 16px;
    }
  }
</style>
